      <description sparkle:format="markdown">Version 1.0, with a user guide. Help › Open PDF Editor Guide (⌘?), or Guide in the welcome window, opens a full guide to the app in the app itself: every feature explained step by step with pictures, a table of keyboard shortcuts, and bookmarks to each chapter. Strikethrough now has a working shortcut of its own, ⌃⌘E (it shared ⌃⌘K with Crop).</description>
